<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<mdclass:Subsystem xmlns:mdclass="http://g5.1c.ru/v8/dt/metadata/mdclass" uuid="839caa9e-e140-4474-b7aa-57ab1a1c2789">
  <name>PricesAndDiscounts</name>
  <synonym>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Prices and discounts</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>قیمت‌ها و تخفیف‌ها</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Prezzi e sconti</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Ceny i rabaty</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Цены и скидки</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>Fiyatlar ve indirimler</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Đơn giá và chiết khấu</value>
  </synonym>
  <includeInCommandInterface>true</includeInCommandInterface>
  <explanation>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Generation of price type classifiers, price groups of items, discounts (markups). Pricing of items, generation of standard terms of sales.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>تولید طبقه‌بندی‌های نوع قیمت، گروه‌های قیمت اقلام، تخفیف‌ها (افزایش قیمت‌ها). قیمت‌گذاری اقلام، تولید شرایط استاندارد فروش.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Generazione dei classificatore delle tipologie di prezzo, dei gruppi di prezzi degli articoli, degli sconti (markup). Impostazione dei prezzi degli articoli, generazione degli accordi tipo con clienti.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Tworzenie klasyfikatorów rodzajów cen, cenowych grup nomenklatury, rabatów (marż). Ustalenie cen nomenklatury, tworzenie typowych umów z klientami.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Формирование классификаторов видов цен, ценовых групп номенклатуры, скидок (наценок). Установка цен номенклатуры, формирование типовых соглашений с клиентами.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>Fiyat türü sınıflandırıcılarının, ürün fiyat gruplarının, indirimlerin (marjların) oluşturulması. Ürün fiyatlarını belirleme, müşterilerle standart sözleşmelerin düzenlenmesi.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Tạo bảng phân loại dạng giá, nhóm giá mặt hàng, chiết khấu (phụ thu). Đặt bảng giá, tạo thỏa thuận chung với khách hàng.</value>
  </explanation>
